: "432285677886946", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458091_432285681220279_7535572255127238121_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dtpwuf8f9BUQ7kNvwGTtYnA&_nc_oc=Adkr-gFTjly26xG35dX3oU16R9n2aeOCel5l2FeDSvEGC5el10SzAoo-iaVkjQEz9nI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwAXoP7KA_wQa-FsoxKWi5O2uKu-xyc68pcEp-v20bu9A&oe=69B00237"}, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TwqWZF0sz_cQ7kNvwEUjynP&_nc_oc=AdmEZAnLUkCyF0T6UbpXtDOeUz5VbifJd_zafcouigf-jDC6AxFVfm3zNnk0kPGwFdc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxogjlqZAAhqGx2nJz0pKwZKEvi0ZTqIHpy4t-_KtJVpQ&oe=69B00C5E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QlTr5dODtOIQ7kNvwGMz6DY&_nc_oc=Adl-hZ0P3q21Bqjbf3au6USguCt4AAWvHfvPHJr6Y0r2GkSXe-3FIcZYGXB_BTuwksw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwXvTuvdWXyaslSHA6186wCn8gMfpjvC264iEUVwfYLCg&oe=69B021FB"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f5sXhfdz3oUQ7kNvwGFMRMa&_nc_oc=Adn9kVeNwEYV_KxDgEDypRNtpywCaJ4Bz6LHDdKpq_2_7dZVWhks2tAKjvtLC-0LID8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz3O1gSt3SEDnLTk17YQfVqrkwXJ8OPckxXu1-9fWVE3g&oe=69B00E21"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j5fWfJb1begQ7kNvwGNM9Oy&_nc_oc=AdlJImhxdmvEiD1SX1SqYX_vdBVQDjQSTpi2U7yvCEDiCBFNe4Zq7lQRtWWCPkNHgV8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzUR9etuVPY2HvIC3HGxTxETYcooBOQTAfXn5SA8QaI5w&oe=69B02808"}, {"file_name": "CoverPor